---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: project.run(args)
---
Search, list and read past Claude Code sessions

Usage: claudegrep [OPTIONS] [QUERY]... [COMMAND]

Commands:
  list    List sessions, most recent first
  read    Read a session as markdown, paged
  search  Search (the default when a query is given)
  index   Index every project now (search does this on its own)
  status  Show what is indexed and archived
  forget  Remove an archived session from claudegrep
  config  Show or change settings
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Arguments:
  [QUERY]...  What to search for (same as `claudegrep search <query>`)

Options:
  -n, --limit <LIMIT>  Number of matching chunks to show [config: limit]
  -B, --before <N>     Also show the N chunks before each match, from the same session
  -A, --after <N>      Also show the N chunks after each match, from the same session
  -C, --context <N>    Also show N chunks before and after each match
      --all            Use every project's sessions, not only those of the current directory
      --under <DIR>    Use the sessions of DIR and of every directory below it
      --since <WHEN>   Only sessions active since WHEN: a date (2026-10-14) or an age (30m, 6h, 2d, 1w, 3mo)
      --until <WHEN>   Only sessions active until WHEN: a date (whole day included) or an age
      --db <FILE>      Database with the index, the transcript archive and the settings [env: CLAUDEGREP_DB=[ROOT]/db.sqlite]
  -h, --help           Print help (see more with '--help')
  -V, --version        Print version
